WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
[Restrained electronic texture]
ONE SHOT · 90 SECONDS
Demo Day is one moment.

00:07.000 --> 00:16.000
90 seconds. One room. Then the lights come up.

00:16.000 --> 00:25.000
[Whoosh]
But the story does not stop there.

00:25.000 --> 00:34.000
For the customer deciding whether to try you.
[Proof highlighted]
Your proof.

00:34.000 --> 00:41.000
Make the founder story keep working.

00:41.000 --> 00:45.000
